Bind Npc 14431 Zone 2
Quest 466 "[Repeatable Solo] Treant Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Beth has commissioned you to hunt Trent. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 20 of 5401, 5451 at direction_505

Requires player level >= 53 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 1250000 experience or 1900000 with premium

direction_505 = location "Treant" about "Treant\nLevels attacks using branches\nold vines afford exceptional Defense Power" found "El Morad" at 931 1828 in zone 2

On available
    Say "Master, [Sentinel] Beth's gravely concerned on account of the monsters. What if you go ahead and hunt them down first?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "I never knew protecting the village was this demanding."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Is there anything you want to say to me... If not, I have to get going. I'm on my want to hunt treants."

On in_progress
    Say "Hmm... looks like you're in the middle of a hunt."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_505

On ready
    Say "The hunt's over!! Let's go see [Sentinel] Hashan now."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Whoa... you've hunted treants. That's my job. Thank you. This is your compensation. Please accept it."
